Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Swedish language analysis tool
 svlang is a command-line tool for analyzing Swedish text. It provides
 grammar checking, word frequency analysis, readability scoring, and
 other linguistic analysis features for the Swedish language.
